      "writtenOn": "2021-11-05T22:27:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The test TestTemplateExpandActionSubstitutions in aquery_test.go in this CL should give some ideas of how this method works. \n\nSubstitutions is a list of key-value pair, field \"key\" is a string token that will be  replaced with field \"value\" in the template content. In this process we sometimes don\u0027t want to use the value provided by Bazel, so TemplateActionOverriddenTokens is used to override the value from Bazel. Currently this is used only for overriding the value for %python_binary% in python binary stub script which points to \"bazel_tools/tools/python/py3wrapper.sh\" in aaquery output. But py3wrapper.sh is not in aquery output so we use python3 here.",
      "parentUuid": "653689ab_6bbcfae9",
      "revId": "b83704a5b6397e1c37a693cb0e03eeca4041f6d6",
