      "writtenOn": "2021-11-05T14:48:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "elsewhere in this file we use proptools.ShellEscapeList and proptools.ShellEscapeIncludingSpaces (from http://go/aocs/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/blueprint/proptools/escape.go) -- would one of those be an appropriate substitute rather than creating our own escaping?",
      "range": {
