      "writtenOn": "2021-11-05T15:09:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m more focused on appropriately propagating runfiles up the tree for use in cquery, (that is, if a soong modle depends on a bazel target, it should acquire the  transitive runfiles of the bazel target, and register them using appropriate Soong mechanisms).\n\nThis seems like it\u0027s preparing runfiles for specifically a template expand action. Why is this needed? Can you provide some more context on this?",
